0 1| 3) iti", "na prakāśayituṃ śaktā pāśatvānnigaḍādivat", "khaḍge'bhīśumato yadvat tadaṃśasya tvasau bhramaḥ || iti", "dāhābhibhavayoḥ kartuḥ prakāśāyābhivāñchitāḥ", "nābhibhāvyābhirulkābhirdinakṛccābhibhāvakaḥ", "śivaśaktikale śuddhe śivo dhyeya iti bruvan", "cintayed budhaḥ (rau0 sū0 4 | 42-43) iti", "na dhyeyo nāpi ca jñeyastasmādīśo'ṇubandhanaiḥ", "śakyate", "śivaṃ śaktyādibhiḥ sārdhaṃ paśyatyātmā gatāvṛtiḥ", "na, draṣṭṛdraṣṭavyayordvayorapi vyāpakatvena tathā darśanāsaṃbhavāt", "sakalāṇoḥ śivajñānaṃ dṛśyate tatkathaṃ bhavet", "śabdasyākāśavāyuhetutvena pāśatvāt kathaṃ tatastatpratipattiḥ", "samarthayati ciccakṣurnātaḥ kiñcid virudhyate", "gamyate kāryataḥ khyātād vyakto dehe graho yathā", "pratimādāviva gamyate", "bhavaḥ prakāśaśūnyeṣu vyajyate kathamucyate", "na jaḍe cidrūpasyābhivyaktirupapadyata ityarthaḥ", "svaparātmaprakāśo'yaṃ niṣprakāśeṣu cidvatām", "viśeṣasannidhāno'bhivyajyata ityadoṣaḥ", "bogānte sādhakaḥ siddhiṃ tathaiva prāpnuyād dhruvam", "śivapadaparaiśvaryabhājo bhavanti iti", "teṣāmatulyabuddhitvāt kāryaṃ notpattumarhati", "parameśvarasyaivetyabhyupagantavyamiti", "teṣāmatulyabuddhitvāt kāmabhedo na durlabhaḥ", "siddhāste'to na kāmaistu bhedavadbhiḥ samanvitāḥ", "teneha sarvakāryāṇāmutpattirna virudhyate", "pakṣagrahāsaṃbhavānnābhiprāyabheda iti na kāryānutpādadoṣaprasaṅgo'tra", "nyūnatvānna ca sārvajñamakartṛtvāt paśuryathā", "paśuvad bhavenmukta iti", "anyathā kartṛtā na syādīśvarasyā'pi siddhavat", "īśvaro'pi sarvajñatvādasya sarvakartṛtā'nyathā na syāditi viśvānutpādaprasaṅgaḥ", "kartṛtvasya na cābhāvaḥ sādhitatvāt tatastvasau", "vyajyate kartṛtā siddhe sarvatra jñānavanna ca", "kartavyamiti saṃcintya siddho na karaṇīyaṃ karotīti", "siddhe vyaktā paśau neti viśeṣaḥ kastayoryadi", "ko viśeṣaḥ", "pravṛttiḥ sarvaniṣpattau vyaktirnānyā tu tadgatā", "sarvakṛtyapravṛttau vā nāsāvastīti varṇyatām", "sarvajñatvasarvakartṛtvalakṣaṇataiva muktirabhyupagantavyā", "vimokṣe guṇasaṃkrāntāvīśo'nīśvaratāṃ vrajet", "tyaktvā svaguṇinaṃ yānti na ca guṇyantara